The current comment suggests registering in `opencode.json` `"hooks": {...}` — that is a Claude Code mechanism, dead in opencode. Rewrite the comment to say the native mechanism is the plugin (helenize-<slug>/index.ts); the .sh stays as an optional standalone utility and is NOT registered anywhere. Do not change its behavior otherwise.

